{"nodes": [{"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_successor_semantic_contract", "label": "Proposed Successor Expression Contract", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/successor/semantic-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "PROPOSAL \u2014 SP01.3 expression layer only. Not a registered execution profile. Does not replace moriarty-funded-source/0, the syntax profile, or archived candidate04. The 38 proposed financial operations are not defined here."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_successor_semantic_contract_moriarty_expression_contract_1", "label": "moriarty-expression-contract/1", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/successor/semantic-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Deliberately distinct from contract/0. A compiler, signature or proof bound to the strict lineage cannot silently opt into /1. Source hashes and eventual semantic profile hashes remain distinct."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_successor_semantic_contract_ex_d1", "label": "EX-D1 Short-Circuit And/Or", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/successor/semantic-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Left-to-right short-circuit matching the source design. Both operands statically checked and all snapshots admitted before reduction; only the selected right operand is evaluated. Replaces strict EX-D1 of contract/0 under a distinct contract/1 identifier."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_successor_semantic_contract_ex_d2", "label": "EX-D2 Checked Same-Type Arithmetic", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/successor/semantic-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Checked same-type scalar arithmetic, indexed amount/share addition and subtraction, explicit quantity scale/unit arithmetic. No implicit asset, scale, width or debt conversion. Makes overflow and rounding visible."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_successor_semantic_contract_ex_d3", "label": "EX-D3 Closed ReadPre Views", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/successor/semantic-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "ReadPre has closed view operand pre|post; post is legal only in Ensure's condition. No 41st constructor and no ReadNext. Read-view is part of Core encoding, never inferred from a name."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_successor_semantic_contract_ex_d4", "label": "EX-D4 Ordinary Work Unit", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/successor/semantic-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every entered node costs one ordinary work unit. Finite helper operations do not each count as nodes. Failed preparation reports consumed local work but publishes no candidate financial state/effects. Proposed local cost semantics, not native proof cost."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_successor_semantic_contract_ex_d5", "label": "EX-D5 AccessField Alias of ProjectField", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/successor/semantic-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "AccessField/AccessIndex are exact aliases of ProjectField/ProjectIndex, including errors and work. An optimizer may not delete their node charge without a separate correspondence argument."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_successor_semantic_contract_ex_d6", "label": "EX-D6 Emit Descriptor Only", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/successor/semantic-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Emit appends a typed operation descriptor only. Effects and financial state changes require the separately defined financial-operation transition. There is no default Transfer, repayment or other execution guessed from the descriptor."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_successor_semantic_contract_ex_d7", "label": "EX-D7 Finite Proposal Limits", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/successor/semantic-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Finite parameters are proposal limits independent of existing parser/funded bounds. UTF-8 spans are half-open byte offsets. Whole-action static rejection precedes any execution."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_successor_semantic_contract_ex_d8", "label": "EX-D8 Unit and WriteClass", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/successor/semantic-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Unit is statement-result-only; schema fields are classified ordinary/financial. Raw NextWrite cannot bypass financial transitions. Enforces the inherited no-debt-erasure requirement."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_successor_semantic_contract_v_finite_domains", "label": "V Finite Domains and Values", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/successor/semantic-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_successor_semantic_contract_e_evaluation_contexts", "label": "E Evaluation Contexts and Frames", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/successor/semantic-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_successor_semantic_contract_r_reduction_rules", "label": "R Primitive Reduction Rules", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/successor/semantic-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Integer checks compare mathematical integers to declared bounds and never wrap. A multiplication checks its product before any subsequent division. No integer debt subtraction is a transfer."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_successor_semantic_contract_and_or_short_circuit", "label": "And/Or Short-Circuit Contractions", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/successor/semantic-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_successor_semantic_contract_c_actual_work", "label": "C(e) Actual Ordinary Work", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/successor/semantic-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_successor_semantic_contract_b_conservative_work", "label": "B(e) Conservative Syntax Work Bound", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/successor/semantic-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "B counts one for every constructor occurrence including unselected branches. Conservatively bounds local reduction work; does not estimate validation overhead, lifecycle work or native proof cost."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_successor_semantic_contract_write_class", "label": "writeClass ordinary|financial", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/successor/semantic-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_successor_semantic_contract_read_pre", "label": "ReadPre", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/successor/semantic-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_successor_semantic_contract_operation_descriptor", "label": "Operation Descriptor", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/successor/semantic-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Contains no executable callback. Formed by Emit; it is not a ledger effect."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_successor_semantic_contract_sp03_3_obligations", "label": "SP03.3 Six Obligations", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "experiments/moriarty-language/spec/successor/semantic-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Determinism, progress-or-defined-rejection, type preservation, finite termination, residual-duty conservation and elaboration/evaluator correspondence for the frozen base domain. This source contract and its derivations are not mechanized proofs."}, {"id": "experiments_moriarty_language_spec_successor_semantic_contract_language_design", "label": "LANGUAGE-DESIGN Inherited Requirements", "file_type": 